WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:01.968
-Welcome back, guys.

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:04.267
The big movie this weekend
is "The Batman."

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:07.300
[ Cheers and applause ]
It is getting great reviews,

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.167
and IMAX screenings are selling
out all over America.

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:12.133
So I thought it would be fun
to go around the studio

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:15.701
and see who can give the best,
"I'm Batman."

00:00:15.701 --> 00:00:17.667
I'll go first.
[ Clears throat ]

00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:23.734
[ Dramatic music plays ]

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:26.767
[ Deep voice ] I'm Batman.

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:28.767
And I'm vengeance.

00:00:28.767 --> 00:00:33.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.501
[ Normal voice ] Felt good.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:38.100
Higgins, why don't you give us
your best, "I'm Batman"?

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:41.133
-Okay.

00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:42.767
[ Dramatic music plays ]

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:46.000
[ Deep voice ] I'm Batman, and
I'm here to save Gotham City.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.434
-[ Laughs ]
Why are you smiling at the end?

00:00:51.434 --> 00:00:52.467
-I'm smiling.

00:00:52.467 --> 00:00:54.167
-Yeah, you don't smile
at the end.

00:00:54.167 --> 00:00:57.834
That's a very good Batman.
James, can we see your Batman?

00:00:57.834 --> 00:00:59.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:02.601
-[ Deep voice ] I'm Batman.

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:04.868
You don't want to mess with me

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:07.868
'cause I have
a lot of great ideas

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:11.100
and just don't tell them
to many people.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:18.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.267 --> 00:01:21.467
They'll laugh at me
but not anymore.

00:01:21.467 --> 00:01:23.901
[ Laughter ]
I made a website.

00:01:23.901 --> 00:01:28.801
It's www.spaceport.spaceport

00:01:28.801 --> 00:01:33.334
dot dot James Poyser's
Batman ideas dot piano.

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:38.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.767 --> 00:01:42.334
See you on the information
superhighway.

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:45.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.334 --> 00:01:47.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:50.267 --> 00:01:56.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.334 --> 00:02:02.634
[ Laughter continues ]

